                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[ASTM B348 Gr 2](https://titanium.com/astm-b348-specification/) , [ASTM B381 Gr. F2](https://titanium.com/astm-b381-specification/) , [ASTM F67 Gr 2](https://titanium.com/astm-f67-specification/) , [ASME SB-348 Gr 2](https://titanium.com/asme-sb348-specification/) , EN 10204 3.1"
